# 0237 = 0236 + fixed QIESR0 mask.  QIESR0 readback is unreliable; the
#   0236 read-modify-write caused an IRQ storm (pass rate ~5x).  Write the
#   fixed TX + RX(EP1/EP2) done mask, no readback.
